{"about_the_game":"<strong>Welcome to the golden age of Polish Nobility!</strong><br><br>In Nobility Simulator, you become a proud, lazy, and blissfully unaware Polish nobleman \u2014 a man of honor, strong character, and highly questionable hygiene.<br>Manage your manor, boss your peasants around, sip mead, and occasionally defend your estate from the Swedes\u2026 assuming you\u2019re not too hungover.<br><br>\ud83d\udfeb Remember \u2013 a true nobleman never gets his hands dirty.<br>That\u2019s what peasants are for. Well\u2026 unless they\u2019ve already run off.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/7be5e6b04b39252d1aff49fcfce3e1a4.poster.avif?t=1773908868\" width=640 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/7be5e6b04b39252d1aff49fcfce3e1a4.webm?t=1773908868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udc51 Live large. Live noble.<br>Build, command, and celebrate like a proper Sarmatian. The mead won\u2019t drink itself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/5dbaf6a33ce1c36c67352cf011f41fe5.poster.avif?t=1773908868\" width=640 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/5dbaf6a33ce1c36c67352cf011f41fe5.webm?t=1773908868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83e\uddf9 Servants aren\u2019t your friends.<br>Peasants are your all-purpose workforce. If words fail, the whip speaks volumes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/d3751a781a6a064f0a164e080ca78970.poster.avif?t=1773908868\" width=640 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/d3751a781a6a064f0a164e080ca78970.webm?t=1773908868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>\u2694\ufe0f Make a name for yourself in battle!<br>Peace never lasts. When enemies come knocking, grab your saber and make them regret it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/cc3d9eb810b87a95f2cce960dcef453c.poster.avif?t=1773908868\" width=640 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/cc3d9eb810b87a95f2cce960dcef453c.webm?t=1773908868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>What\u2019s expected of a proper noble:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83c\udf6f Brew vast amounts of mead. No such thing as too much.<br></li><li>\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Take care of your peasants and keep them somewhat healthy. As the old saying goes: &quot;Dead peasants don\u2019t plow well.&quot;<br></li><li>\ud83e\ude93 Expand your estate \u2013 place buildings with strategy\u2026 or just slap them down wherever. It\u2019s all falling apart soon anyway.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc4f Don\u2019t let your subjects slack off \u2013 hire overseers and listen to the sweet crack of their whips echo across the fields.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Fend off enemy invasions \u2013 preferably from a safe distance\u2026 by using your peasants as meat shields.</li></ul><br>Nobility Simulator blends economic management, light combat, and an avalanche of absurd humor to deliver as much glorious chaos as a 17th-century Polish parliament<br><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728900?t=1773908868","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728900?t=1773908868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/cff33a859c05c51f48e38fa6003f2350bcd7a9db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773908868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/cff33a859c05c51f48e38fa6003f2350bcd7a9db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773908868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>Welcome to the golden age of Polish Nobility!</strong><br><br>In Nobility Simulator, you become a proud, lazy, and blissfully unaware Polish nobleman \u2014 a man of honor, strong character, and highly questionable hygiene.<br>Manage your manor, boss your peasants around, sip mead, and occasionally defend your estate from the Swedes\u2026 assuming you\u2019re not too hungover.<br><br>\ud83d\udfeb Remember \u2013 a true nobleman never gets his hands dirty.<br>That\u2019s what peasants are for. Well\u2026 unless they\u2019ve already run off.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/7be5e6b04b39252d1aff49fcfce3e1a4.poster.avif?t=1773908868\" width=640 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/extras/7be5e6b04b39252d1aff49fcfce3e1a4.webm?t=1773908868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udc51 Liv