g as too much.<br></li><li>\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Take care of your peasants and keep them somewhat healthy. As the old saying goes: &quot;Dead peasants don\u2019t plow well.&quot;<br></li><li>\ud83e\ude93 Expand your estate \u2013 place buildings with strategy\u2026 or just slap them down wherever. It\u2019s all falling apart soon anyway.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc4f Don\u2019t let your subjects slack off \u2013 hire overseers and listen to the sweet crack of their whips echo across the fields.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Fend off enemy invasions \u2013 preferably from a safe distance\u2026 by using your peasants as meat shields.</li></ul><br>Nobility Simulator blends economic management, light combat, and an avalanche of absurd humor to deliver as much glorious chaos as a 17th-century Polish parliament<br><br>","developers":["Sombrero Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728900/44554ec358c6f00346fba9adaa5dfea32c81ddd4/header.jpg?t=1773908868","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3728900/1825327079/910f4de296346f8361fa3c0b2ff9c2b983df13db/1750395387/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747810284","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3728900/1825327079/910f4de296346f8361fa3c0b2ff9c2b983df13db/1750395387/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747810284","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3728900/1825327079/910f4de296346f8361fa3c0b2ff9c2b983df13db/17